Package: pipes-xscreensaver
Version: __VERSION__
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: xscreensaver, libx11-6, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0
Maintainer: Brandon Williams <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/brando5393/neo_win_pipes
Description: 3D Pipes screensaver (xscreensaver hack) + settings app
 A cross-platform recreation of the classic Windows 3D Pipes screensaver.
 Installs an xscreensaver "hack" (select "Neo Pipes" in xscreensaver-demo)
 and a standalone "Pipes Settings" app (live preview + settings drawer)
 for configuring pipe count, speed, style, and color palette - the exact
 same shared config file and simulation/rendering code as the Windows
 version.
